#: modules/help.py:40
msgid ""
"**Forward Message Tutorial 📬**\n"
"\n"
"🔎 Want to grab the ID of a user or chat? Just forward a message to me! "
"Here's how:\n"
"\n"
"1️⃣ Find a message in any chat (user, group, channel, or bot).\n"
"2️⃣ Forward it to me privately.\n"
"3️⃣ I'll instantly reveal the ID, name, and more! ⚡\n"
"\n"
"💡 **Pro Tip:** Works with any forwarded message, even from private chats! 😎"
msgstr ""
"**Xabarni yuborish bo'yicha qo'llanma 📬**\n"
"\n"
"🔎 Foydalanuvchi yoki chat ID'sini bilmoqchimisiz? Xabarni menga yuboring! Quyidagicha:\n"
"\n"
"1️⃣ Istalgan chatdan (foydalanuvchi, guruh, kanal yoki bot) xabarni tanlang.\n"
"2️⃣ Uni menga shaxsiy chatda yuboring.\n"
"3️⃣ Men darhol ID, ism va boshqa ma'lumotlarni ko'rsataman! ⚡\n"
"\n"
"💡 **Maslahat:** Hatto xususiy chatlardan yuborilgan xabarlarda ham ishlaydi! 😎"

#: modules/help.py:48
msgid ""
"**Get Me Tutorial 🙋‍♂️**\n"
"\n"
"🔍 Want to know your own Telegram ID? It's super easy!\n"
"\n"
"1️⃣ Just type `/me` in the chat with me.\n"
"2️⃣ I'll send your user ID, name, and username instantly! ⚡\n"
"3️⃣ If you have a profile photo, I'll show it too! 📸\n"
"\n"
"💡 **Pro Tip:** Use the button in the reply to copy your ID! 😎"
msgstr ""
"**Mening ID'm qo'llanmasi 🙋‍♂️**\n"
"\n"
"🔍 O'zingizning Telegram ID'nizni bilmoqchimisiz? Juda oson!\n"
"\n"
"1️⃣ Chatda `/me` deb yozing.\n"
"2️⃣ Men sizning foydalanuvchi ID, ism va username'ni darhol yuboraman! ⚡\n"
"3️⃣ Profil rasmingiz bo'lsa, uni ham ko'rsataman! 📸\n"
"\n"
"💡 **Maslahat:** ID'ni nusxalash uchun javobdagi tugmadan foydalaning! 😎"

#: modules/help.py:56
msgid ""
"**Shared Chat Tutorial 🌐**\n"
"\n"
"🔎 Need the ID of a user, group, or channel? Share it with me!\n"
"\n"
"1️⃣ Type `/start` to see the sharing buttons.\n"
"2️⃣ Pick a user, bot, group, or channel to share.\n"
"3️⃣ I'll fetch the ID, name, and username instantly! ⚡\n"
"\n"
"💡 **Pro Tip:** Works for public and private chats, plus bots and premium users! 😎"
msgstr ""
"**Ulashilgan chat qo'llanmasi 🌐**\n"
"\n"
"🔎 Foydalanuvchi, guruh yoki kanal ID'si kerakmi? Uni menga ulashing!\n"
"\n"
"1️⃣ `/start` ni yozing va ulashish tugmalarini oching.\n"
"2️⃣ Foydalanuvchi, bot, guruh yoki kanalni tanlang.\n"
"3️⃣ Men darhol ID, ism va username'ni ko'rsataman! ⚡\n"
"\n"
"💡 **Maslahat:** Ommaviy va xususiy chatlar, botlar hamda premium foydalanuvchilar uchun ishlaydi! 😎"

#: modules/help.py:64
msgid ""
"**Admins Tutorial 🛡️**\n"
"\n"
"🔍 Want to see where you're an admin? I've got you!\n"
"\n"
"1️⃣ Type `/admin` in the chat with me.\n"
"2️⃣ Use the buttons to share a channel or group where you have admin rights.\n"
"3️⃣ I'll reveal the ID and details instantly! ⚡\n"
"\n"
"💡 **Pro Tip:** Perfect for managing your admin roles! 😎"
msgstr ""
"**Administrator qo'llanmasi 🛡️**\n"
"\n"
"🔍 Qaysi joylarda admin ekansiz – bilmoqchimisiz?\n"
"\n"
"1️⃣ Chatda `/admin` yozing.\n"
"2️⃣ Siz admin bo'lgan guruh yoki kanalni tanlang.\n"
"3️⃣ Men darhol ID va boshqa ma'lumotlarni ko'rsataman! ⚡\n"
"\n"
"💡 **Maslahat:** Adminlik faoliyatingizni boshqarish uchun juda qulay! 😎"

#: modules/help.py:72
msgid ""
"**Own Chats Tutorial 📚**\n"
"\n"
"🔎 Curious about your own channels or groups? Let's find them!\n"
"\n"
"1️⃣ Type `/my` in the chat with me.\n"
"2️⃣ Use the buttons to share a channel or group you own.\n"
"3️⃣ I'll send the ID and details in a snap! ⚡\n"
"\n"
"💡 **Pro Tip:** Great for keeping track of your own chats! 😎"
msgstr ""
"**O'z chatlaringiz qo'llanmasi 📚**\n"
"\n"
"🔎 O'zingizga tegishli guruh yoki kanallarni bilmoqchimisiz?\n"
"\n"
"1️⃣ Chatda `/my` deb yozing.\n"
"2️⃣ O'zingizga tegishli kanal yoki guruhni tanlang.\n"
"3️⃣ Men ID va tafsilotlarni darhol yuboraman! ⚡\n"
"\n"
"💡 **Maslahat:** O'zingizning chatlaringizni kuzatib borish uchun juda foydali! 😎"

#: modules/help.py:80
msgid ""
"**Username Tutorial 👤**\n"
"\n"
"🔎 Want info about a specific user? Just send me their username!\n"
"\n"
"1️⃣ Type a username (e.g., `@username`) in the chat with me.\n"
"2️⃣ I'll fetch their ID, name, and other details instantly! ⚡\n"
"3️⃣ If they have a profile photo, I'll show it too! 📸\n"
"\n"
"💡 **Pro Tip:** Works for any public username, even bots! 😎"
msgstr ""
"**Foydalanuvchi nomi qo'llanmasi 👤**\n"
"\n"
"🔎 Ma'lum bir foydalanuvchi haqida bilmoqchimisiz? Uning username'ni menga yuboring!\n"
"\n"
"1️⃣ Chatga username yozing (masalan, `@username`).\n"
"2️⃣ Men darhol uning ID, ism va boshqa ma'lumotlarini ko'rsataman! ⚡\n"
"3️⃣ Agar foydalanuvchida profil rasmi bo'lsa, uni ham ko'rsataman! 📸\n"
"\n"
"💡 **Maslahat:** Har qanday ommaviy username, hatto botlar uchun ham ishlaydi! 😎"

